{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_033_1000_p", "source_sha256": "9e18386d2fa4bae33e295ceca06c4f79f99d8ed13c22d7cdbb8fbad0bb0c7cf7", "ja": "環、公演のブログ読んだよ。上手に書けてたぞ。\n世界中のみんなに……願いはでっかく、って感じだな！", "zh": "环，我看过你部落格里关于公演的文章了，写得很好喔。\n献给全世界的人……感觉愿望很远大呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_033_1001_040tam", "source_sha256": "ab70f454179e7bafd310cab6614c3c98014d71e806668ad1a4733c88ff7fa3a2", "ja": "うん！　おやぶん、たまきの気持ち、\nみんなに伝わったかな？", "zh": "嗯！老大，\n环的心情有传达给大家了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_033_1002_p", "source_sha256": "04b9296a7f5ed8b6980b57e8f5233d4962b395b4d8e98197019e0760a9b2f9a3", "ja": "ああ、ばっちりだと思う！", "zh": "有喔，我觉得有充分传达给大家了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_033_1003_040tam", "source_sha256": "690cfb864270dacee3e1b83f4cfcd841422eefe46a40fcce645bc677ac3a27a0", "ja": "本当！？\nよかった～。くふふ♪", "zh": "真的吗！？\n太好了～呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_033_1004_040tam", "source_sha256": "59807296746e1c53e6032733c4bcf7a67f5f4b3599c9ae06a4cc73fb36fccf12", "ja": "でもたまき、世界中のみんなを笑顔にするの、\nいっぱい時間かかっちゃうかも……。", "zh": "不过环可能要花上很多时间，\n才能为全世界的人带来笑容吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_033_1005_p", "source_sha256": "404493f6d678bbbac63497526727b41b923ce8e76a0dafdb4f0ecdd80eb469ba", "ja": "そうかもしれないな。\nでも、一歩ずつ進んでいけば大丈夫なんじゃないか？", "zh": "或许吧，但只要一步一步脚踏实地往前走，\n应该就没问题吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_033_1006_p", "source_sha256": "04f31ff7172bfff0c79ff08e094a2012a2de32a313d5ad3a25a7c7aa9c4eacba", "ja": "いきなり世界中は無理でも、身近なところから\n頑張っていけば、笑顔は広がっていくはずだからな！", "zh": "虽然很难一下子就为全世界的人带来笑容，\n但只要从身边开始努力，笑容就会逐渐散播出去的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_033_1007_040tam", "source_sha256": "52df0015294d7390241404d4d88f769e60e634adcfc9c30ef6b182446d3903c4", "ja": "そっかぁ……。\nうん、たまき、がんばる！", "zh": "这样啊……\n嗯，环会加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_033_1008_040tam", "source_sha256": "08b0fdec3a2ab95710f627ed7c1c32ade978cd7e5effd64dc2001265c71dfc3c", "ja": "じゃあ最初は……劇場のみんなに、\n笑顔になってもらわないとだね！", "zh": "那首先……得让剧场的伙伴们\n露出开怀的笑容才行呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_033_1009_p", "source_sha256": "295f3586f694bbbc9efd6d8d95241038070d0ddea012a0e29023323485341785", "ja": "ああ、まずはそこからだな。", "zh": "没错，先从那里做起吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_033_1010_040tam", "source_sha256": "2bbe7f8844d0b940d1bbe345184fdc5e94d9017afd2db22ab6242f0b3ef90420", "ja": "じゃあたまき、今度は虫だけじゃなくて、\nカエルとかカタツムリとか捕まえてくる！", "zh": "那环下次不只要捕虫，\n还要把青蛙和蜗牛之类的也捕回来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_033_1011_p", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_033_1012_040tam", "source_sha256": "51e616f19fd0fd5ba315cac135d2dd4b5ca052acf4946caef9f51f078b0745a4", "ja": "みんなに、カッコイイやつあげるぞ～！\nおやぶん！　たまき、行ってくるね！", "zh": "环要送给大家帅气的东西～！\n老大！环要出发啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_033_1013_p", "source_sha256": "04eaededa68a3c41c204d3d3d3129df5046142ea2f461d15f71d836df94e52b5", "ja": "ま、待て、環！\n劇場に生き物を持ち込むんじゃ……環ー！", "zh": "慢、慢着，环！\n不可以把生物带进剧场内……环──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
